msgid ""
"Urubamba está a 2 871 msnm. Le recomendamos descansar y tomar mate de coca "
"al llegar. Contamos con oxígeno y custodia de equipaje si viaja a Machu "
"Picchu."
msgstr ""
"Urubamba is 2,871 m above sea level. We recommend resting and drinking coca "
"tea on arrival. We offer oxygen and luggage storage if you travel to Machu "
"Picchu."

